{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03765","headline":"赋得妾薄命 · 杜审言","name":"赋得妾薄命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草绿长门掩，苔青永巷幽。\n宠移新爱夺，泪落故情留。\n啼鸟惊残梦，飞花搅独愁。\n自怜春色罢，团扇复迎秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}